Eca
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 70 DEAL OVI
OVI 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OVI 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OVI 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OVI 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OVI 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OVI 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OVI 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OVI 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OVI 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OVI 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE OVI OVI
DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK OVI OVI
DESTSRC Rank ascending
DRAW
PILE ALL OVI Size > 0
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL OVI Empty
        PILE ALL OVI Empty
